OL,3,GNEWSAPolice failings in friends' death
OL,4,Aon mountain ridge could risk lives,
OL,5,Acoroner warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore people could die on remote
OL,8,Fmountains unless police do a better job
OL,9,Fin responding to dropped 999 calls, a
OL,10,Fcoroner has warned.
OL,12,FThe bodies of friends Eddie Hill, 20,
OL,13,Fand Jayden Long, 19, both from Dereham,
OL,14,FNorfolk, were found on a mountain ridge
OL,15,Fin Eryri, also known as Snowdonia, on
OL,16,F19 February, a day after a call from
OL,17,FLong to North Wales Police was
OL,18,Fdisconnected.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
