OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice failings in friends' death
OL,4,Aon mountain ridge could risk lives,
OL,5,Acoroner warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FOfficers did try unsuccessfully to call
OL,8,Fhim back, but then made "limited"
OL,9,Fefforts to find out who owned the phone
OL,10,Fand took more than three hours to alert
OL,11,Fmountain rescue, assistant coroner
OL,12,FSarah Riley said.
OL,14,FNorth Wales Police said it had taken
OL,15,Fsteps to strengthen its policies and
OL,16,Fprocedures.
